    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40298" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινείφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>snow upon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.14.6
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				5.9.13
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὸς ἐπινείφει
			δρόσον</span> (i.e. manna) <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.112
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷς δ᾽ ὁ θεὸς</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινείφει καὶ ἐπομβρεῖ τὰς ἀγαθῶν
					πηγάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.296
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.383
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνθυμήματα</span>
			<i>are dropped, distilled into</i> the mind, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.441
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. impers.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινείφει</span>
			<i>fresh snow falls</i>, or <i>it keeps snowing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>.</div>
